<title>USA: PSE to list Parker Drilling options Dec 11.</title>
<headline>PSE to list Parker Drilling options Dec 11.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Stock Exchange said Wednesday it will list options on Parker Drilling Co Dec 11.</p>
<p>Parker Drilling options will have strike prices of 7-1/2, 10 and 12-1/2 and initial expirations of January, February, April and July.</p>
<p>Parker Drilling shares were up 1/8 at 9-7/8 Wednesday.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to pit representatives Craig Resnick and Samuel Brown of the Biochem Pharma Inc trading crowd, the exchange said. ((Derivatives desk 3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
